  "changes": [
    "Decode native MTL views, ArrayBuffers and Blobs directly as UTF-8; data URLs use native byte fetching and the same text decoder. Avoid binary-string corruption and unnecessary material URLs.",
    "Preserve Three-supported -s, -o, -bm and -mm option arities while resolving filenames with spaces; include norm, bump and disp aliases alongside map_* directives.",
    "Normalize binary texture sidecars as exact owned Blob snapshots, retain URLs through image loading and revoke on completion, failure or abort. Borrowed strings remain caller-owned.",
    "Use a scoped LoadingManager sentinel to wait for referenced image loads and report image failures. Create materials on demand instead of preloading unused images.",
    "Race material/texture resolvers and material fetch, body and Blob reads against cancellation; reject pre-aborted loads and observe late failures.",
    "Dispose abandoned geometry/materials/textures on abort or parse failure. Clean copied line/point material caches while preserving retained shared textures."
  ],
